      "subject": "וישכב עם אבתיו",
      "rationale": "\"A robetše le bo-ntate ba gagwe\" — sekgowa sa go bolela lehu, e sego boroko bo bolego."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "מלכי ישראל",
      "rationale": "Puku e bolela \"dikgoši tša Yisraele\" go na le tša Yehuda — Akaze e be e le kgoši ya Yehuda; bao ba fetolelang ba ngwala \"tša Yisraele\" ka gobane leo le kwa le le kwano."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme Akaze a robetše le bo-ntate ba gagwe, gomme ba mo hlabile toropong, Yerushalayime; ka gobane ba be ba se ka mo isa go mabitleng a dikgoši tša Yisraele; gomme Hizikiya morwa wa gagwe a busa legato la gagwe.",
